0",{"dimensions":59,"alt":62,"copyright":46,"url":63,"id":64,"edit":65},{"width":60,"height":61},88,24,"Send","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},0,1,"transparent","international_hero_banner$1a3a5ef0-f1e1-4ea9-8b76-98774929dd13","international_hero_banner",{"variation":72,"version":31,"items":73,"primary":75,"id":110,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":46},"cardWithImageNoCta",[74],{},{"CardImage":76,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":85,"CardText":86,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":80,"copyright":46,"url":81,"id":82,"edit":83},{"width":78,"height":79},1616,1080,"New Zealand","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VkKJbqstJ98utn_NZL.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z2VkKJbqstJ98utn",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"none","Ship a parcel to New Zealand",[87,92],{"type":88,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":91},"paragraph","Whether you need to send items to friends in Wellington, or family in more remote areas like Stewart Island (Rakiura), you’ll need a courier service you can trust to get your items halfway around the world.",[],"ltr",{"type":88,"text":93,"spans":94,"direction":91},"Of course, it's not just New Zealand that you can send a parcel to. We also ship from the UK to Australia, and offer postage to Canada, as well as 200+ countries and territories.",[95,102,104,109],{"start":96,"end":97,"type":98,"data":99},76,105,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":100,"target":101},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Faustralia","_blank",{"start":96,"end":97,"type":103},"strong",{"start":105,"end":106,"type":98,"data":107},117,134,{"link_type":36,"url":108,"target":101},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fcanada",{"start":105,"end":106,"type":103},"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":113,"version":31,"items":114,"primary":135,"id":148,"slice_type":149,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[115,120,125,130],{"column_1_cell":116,"column_2_cell":117,"column_3_cell":118,"column_4_cell":119},"250g","£15.30","£11.89","£3.41",{"column_1_cell":121,"column_2_cell":122,"column_3_cell":123,"column_4_cell":124},"500g","£16.30","£13.39","£2.91",{"column_1_cell":126,"column_2_cell":127,"column_3_cell":128,"column_4_cell":129},"1kg","£20.25","£18.19","£2.06",{"column_1_cell":131,"column_2_cell":132,"column_3_cell":133,"column_4_cell":134},"2kg","£32.05","£27.29","£4.76",{"SectionTitle":136,"SectionSubtitle":137,"TableFooter":138,"InformationTableButtonUrl":139,"InformationTableButtonText":142,"table_header_row_blue":20,"table_rightmost_column_blue":143,"column_name_1":144,"column_name_2":145,"column_name_3":146,"column_name_4":147},"Post to New Zealand cheaply","Even on the other side of the world, we’ll make sure you get a great service for a low price when sending a parcel to New Zealand. You can send up to 15kg with Evri. See how little it can cost to post to New Zealand based on popular parcel weights:","*Royal Mail prices quoted are for an International Tracked delivery of a small 1kg parcel to New Zealand vs a tracked Evri parcel of the same weight. Prices compared at https:\u002F\u002Fwww.royalmail.com\u002Fprices2026 on 14\u002F05\u002F2026. Other features of the services, including transit times and compensation levels, will differ. Different terms and conditions will apply.",{"link_type":36,"key":140,"url":141},"7804ef26-886c-4af2-bc95-ca88051bf801","\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to New Zealand",true,"Weight","Royal Mail","Evri","Savings","information_table_v2$c14b8311-2ec2-4f70-9903-770161d5485e","information_table_v2",{"variation":151,"version":31,"items":152,"primary":154,"id":213,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[153],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":155,"CardText":156,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":211,"IsEco":20},"National holidays in New Zealand",[157,160,166,171,176,181,186,190,195,200,204,208],{"type":88,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":91},"As with all countries and territories we deliver to, New Zealand is home to numerous national holidays that can increase delivery times. If your parcel is in transit around any of the following public holidays, delivery times may be increased:",[],{"type":161,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":91},"list-item","New Year’s Day – 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[164],{"start":66,"end":165,"type":103},17,{"type":161,"text":167,"spans":168,"direction":91},"Waitangi Day – 06\u002F02\u002F2026",[169],{"start":66,"end":170,"type":103},14,{"type":161,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":91},"Good Friday – 03\u002F04\u002F2026",[174],{"start":66,"end":175,"type":103},13,{"type":161,"text":177,"spans":178,"direction":91},"Easter Monday – 06\u002F04\u002F2026",[179],{"start":66,"end":180,"type":103},15,{"type":161,"text":182,"spans":183,"direction":91},"Anzac Day – 25\u002F04\u002F2026",[184],{"start":66,"end":185,"type":103},11,{"type":161,"text":187,"spans":188,"direction":91},"King’s Birthday – 01\u002F06\u002F2026",[189],{"start":66,"end":165,"type":103},{"type":161,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":91},"Matariki – 10\u002F07\u002F2026",[193],{"start":66,"end":194,"type":103},10,{"type":161,"text":196,"spans":197,"direction":91},"Labour Day – 27\u002F10\u002F2026",[198],{"start":66,"end":199,"type":103},12,{"type":161,"text":201,"spans":202,"direction":91},"Christmas Day – 25\u002F12\u002F2026",[203],{"start":66,"end":180,"type":103},{"type":161,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":91},"Boxing Day – 26\u002F12\u002F2026",[207],{"start":66,"end":199,"type":103},{"type":88,"text":209,"spans":210,"direction":91},"Certain regional areas of New Zealand also hold their own holidays. We recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time.",[],{"link_type":212},"Any","card$e2aca6fa-e306-4537-9c6e-ed81a3c031f3",{"variation":215,"version":31,"items":216,"primary":280,"id":291,"slice_type":292,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[217,240,259],{"Title":218,"Description":223,"Image":227,"Label":46,"UrlText":221,"Url":236,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":239,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[219],{"type":220,"text":221,"spans":222},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[224],{"type":88,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":91},"Send a parcel by booking your delivery online. Print your label at home or head to your local ParcelShop where you can use our print in-store device for free and drop off your parcel. We're also in selected Post Office stores where you can book deliveries in person.",[],{"dimensions":228,"alt":231,"copyright":46,"url":232,"id":233,"edit":234},{"width":229,"height":230},1000,665,"Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront.","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw",{"x":66,"y":235,"zoom":67,"background":68},8,{"link_type":36,"key":237,"url":238},"415d960a-e62c-4baa-94d6-72965dfd4bae","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":212},{"Title":241,"Description":245,"Image":249,"Label":46,"UrlText":243,"Url":255,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":258,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[242],{"type":220,"text":243,"spans":244},"Lockers",[],[246],{"type":88,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":91},"Like our ParcelShops, you can book your delivery online and choose to drop off at a secure Locker near you. Simply scan your barcode upon arrival and place your parcel in an available space. We'll collect it ready to send to New Zealand.",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":251,"copyright":46,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":229,"height":230},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":66,"y":165,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":256,"url":257},"185ec23c-295f-4d7e-adba-d240a68a4158","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":212},{"Title":260,"Description":264,"Image":268,"Label":46,"UrlText":275,"Url":276,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":279,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[261],{"type":220,"text":262,"spans":263},"Courier collection",[],[265],{"type":88,"text":266,"spans":267,"direction":91},"If you want to book a collection from your home or office, go online and choose a day that suits you. We'll provide you with a one-hour window, so you know when our courier will arrive at your doorstep.",[],{"dimensions":269,"alt":270,"copyright":46,"url":271,"id":272,"edit":273},{"width":229,"height":230},"An older woman hands a parcel to a courier for collection. The courier is taking a photo.","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10245.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=68%2C0%2C7675%2C5104&w=1000&h=665","Z6ou1pbqstJ9-cSH",{"x":274,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},68,"Courier Services",{"link_type":36,"key":277,"url":278},"babe3238-4660-457b-9ba2-07605cb03c9b","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":212},{"SectionTitle":281,"SectionDescription":286,"theme":290},[282],{"type":283,"text":284,"spans":285},"heading2","How to ship to New Zealand",[],[287],{"type":88,"text":288,"spans":289,"direction":91},"We offer three quick and easy ways to start sending a parcel to New Zealand:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":113,"version":31,"items":294,"primary":296,"id":321,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":46},[295],{},{"CardImage":297,"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":303,"CardText":304,"ButtonText":318,"ButtonUrl":319,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":298,"alt":299,"copyright":46,"url":300,"id":301,"edit":302},{"width":229,"height":230},"Customer sat at a desk posing for a photo and smiling. Multiple parcels are shown in the foreground.","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R6b5bqstJ9-SUg_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8742.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R6b5bqstJ9-SUg",{"x":66,"y":235,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Sending multiple parcels to New Zealand",[305,308,312,315],{"type":88,"text":306,"spans":307,"direction":91},"You can make use of our Bulk Integrations tool to start sending multiple international parcels in one go. Just follow the steps below:",[],{"type":309,"text":310,"spans":311,"direction":91},"o-list-item","Log in to your Evri account on our sister site and link your marketplace seller’s account - eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or another platform. You can also upload parcels via a CSV file.",[],{"type":309,"text":313,"spans":314,"direction":91},"Pack your items, book online, then print your postage label at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop device. ",[],{"type":309,"text":316,"spans":317,"direction":91},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or arrange for a courier collection.",[],"Send multiple items to New Zealand",{"link_type":36,"key":320,"url":38},"28588aab-cede-4ce6-96ea-12a0e3638459","card$9415eb88-416f-4586-bb8f-fce73cf332fc",{"variation":323,"version":31,"items":324,"primary":405,"id":409,"slice_type":410,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[325,344,357,369,381,393],{"title":326,"content":327,"icon":337},"Regular tracking updates",[328],{"type":88,"text":329,"spans":330,"direction":91},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[331,336],{"start":332,"end":333,"type":98,"data":334},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":335,"target":101},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":332,"end":333,"type":103},{"dimensions":338,"alt":340,"copyright":46,"url":341,"id":342,"edit":343},{"width":339,"height":339},40,"Phone icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":345,"content":346,"icon":350},"Parcel cover",[347],{"type":88,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":91},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":351,"alt":352,"copyright":46,"url":353,"id":354,"edit":355},{"width":339,"height":339},"Money icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":356},"#fff",{"title":358,"content":359,"icon":363},"Customs made easier",[360],{"type":88,"text":361,"spans":362,"direction":91},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":364,"alt":365,"copyright":46,"url":366,"id":367,"edit":368},{"width":339,"height":339},"Passport icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":356},{"title":370,"content":371,"icon":375},"Flexible printing options",[372],{"type":88,"text":373,"spans":374,"direction":91},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":376,"alt":377,"copyright":46,"url":378,"id":379,"edit":380},{"width":339,"height":339},"Printer icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":356},{"title":382,"content":383,"icon":387},"Bulk Send",[384],{"type":88,"text":385,"spans":386,"direction":91},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our Bulk Send tool",[],{"dimensions":388,"alt":389,"copyright":46,"url":390,"id":391,"edit":392},{"width":339,"height":339},"Strapped boxes icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":394,"content":395,"icon":399},"Trusted by top UK brands",[396],{"type":88,"text":397,"spans":398,"direction":91},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":400,"alt":401,"copyright":46,"url":402,"id":403,"edit":404},{"width":339,"height":339},"Success icon","new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":406,"title":407,"description":408},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","No matter how far your parcel needs to go, you get all of the following benefits when you choose to send with Evri:","list_block$a49c37c2-bb33-4f57-9ca1-e99ede51edb4","list_block",{"variation":151,"version":31,"items":412,"primary":414,"id":442,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":46},[413],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":415,"CardText":416,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":441,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to New Zealand",[417,425],{"type":88,"text":418,"spans":419,"direction":91},"While you can send lots of items to New Zealand with Evri, there are some limitations which our Couriers cannot transport. Take a look at exactly what you can and can’t send with our prohibited items list.",[420,424],{"start":421,"end":422,"type":98,"data":423},183,204,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":101},{"start":421,"end":422,"type":103},{"type":88,"text":426,"spans":427,"direction":91},"You should also be sure to follow the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and the UK Civil Aviation Authority guides for the latest restrictions for shipping to New Zealand via air.",[428,433,435,440],{"start":429,"end":430,"type":98,"data":431},38,70,{"link_type":36,"url":432,"target":101},"new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":429,"end":434,"type":103},71,{"start":436,"end":437,"type":98,"data":438},79,106,{"link_type":36,"url":439,"target":101},"new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":436,"end":437,"type":103},{"link_type":212},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":151,"version":31,"items":444,"primary":446,"id":497,"slice_type":111,"slice_label":46},[445],{},{"CardAvatar":84,"CardTitle":447,"CardText":448,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":496,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when sending to New Zealand",[449,452,455,458,461,464,467,470,474,479,484,489,493],{"type":88,"text":450,"spans":451},"When you send a parcel to New Zealand, you'll need to follow the correct address structure. This is similar to the structure we use within the UK, with a few slight differences:",[],{"type":161,"text":453,"spans":454},"The recipient's name",[],{"type":161,"text":456,"spans":457},"The apartment or house number\u002F street number and name",[],{"type":161,"text":459,"spans":460},"The suburb",[],{"type":161,"text":462,"spans":463},"The town\u002Fcity and postcode",[],{"type":161,"text":465,"spans":466},"The country name in capitals",[],{"type":88,"text":468,"spans":469},"For example:",[],{"type":88,"text":471,"spans":472},"Mr J. Bloggs",[473],{"start":66,"end":199,"type":103},{"type":88,"text":475,"spans":476},"8\u002F13 West Street",[477],{"start":66,"end":478,"type":103},16,{"type":88,"text":480,"spans":481},"Roslyn",[482],{"start":66,"end":483,"type":103},6,{"type":88,"text":485,"spans":486},"Palmerton North 4414",[487],{"start":66,"end":488,"type":103},20,{"type":88,"text":490,"spans":491},"NEW ZEALAND",[492],{"start":66,"end":185,"type":103},{"type":88,"text":494,"spans":495},"But don’t worry, as long as you have the address information above, our automated address tool will do all the work for you and produce a label for your parcel in the right format.",[],{"link_type":212},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":113,"version":31,"items":499,"primary":568,"id":570,"slice_type":571,"slice_label":46},[500,506,524,556],{"questionTitle":501,"questionBody":502},"How long does it take to ship to New Zealand?",[503],{"type":88,"text":504,"spans":505,"direction":91},"Being on the other side of the world, it usually takes 10-13 days for us to deliver a parcel to New Zealand.",[],{"questionTitle":507,"questionBody":508},"Will I need to deal with customs when posting to New Zealand?",[509,512,515],{"type":88,"text":510,"spans":511,"direction":91},"Some carriers ask you to print out a customs form and attach it to your parcel. Not with Evri. When you buy a parcel online, we automatically take all the information we need during checkout, making it even easier for you.",[],{"type":88,"text":513,"spans":514,"direction":91},"Be careful to fill in all the information correctly to make sure your parcel arrives at its destination as quickly as possible. If the information you provide is incorrect, it could result in your parcel being held at customs, with delays and charges outside of our control.",[],{"type":88,"text":516,"spans":517,"direction":91},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information.",[518,523],{"start":519,"end":520,"type":98,"data":521},30,65,{"link_type":36,"url":522,"target":101},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":519,"end":520,"type":103},{"questionTitle":525,"questionBody":526},"Is there import tax from the UK to New Zealand?",[527,530,533,536,539,543,550,553],{"type":88,"text":528,"spans":529,"direction":91},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":531,"spans":532,"direction":91},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":88,"text":534,"spans":535,"direction":91},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"type":88,"text":537,"spans":538,"direction":91},"",[],{"type":540,"text":541,"spans":542,"direction":91},"heading5","Levy on low-value parcels",[],{"type":88,"text":544,"spans":545,"direction":91},"From 1 April 2026, the New Zealand government introduced a new Low Value Goods Levy. This replaces existing customs transaction fees to cover the cost of processing international parcels. ",[546,548],{"start":547,"end":165,"type":103},5,{"start":333,"end":549,"type":103},83,{"type":88,"text":551,"spans":552,"direction":91},"The levy applies to items worth $1,000 NZD (£440) or less and parcels that enter or leave New Zealand. This includes packages and documents. ",[],{"type":88,"text":554,"spans":555,"direction":91},"$2.21 NZD + 15% GST (Goods and Services Tax) will be added to every item that meets these rules for entering New Zealand. Your recipient will be notified to request payment, if applicable.",[],{"questionTitle":557,"questionBody":558},"Can I track my international parcels?",[559],{"type":88,"text":560,"spans":561,"direction":91},"Yes. You can track your Evri parcel to New Zealand. All you need to do is enter your tracking number on our international tracking page to see where your parcel is.",[562,567],{"start":563,"end":564,"type":98,"data":565},108,135,{"link_type":36,"url":566,"target":101},"new-zealand.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":563,"end":564,"typ